{"d":12,"passage":{"title":"曼斯菲尔德庄园","author":"Jane Austen","text":"The want of common discretion, of caution: his going down to Richmond for the whole time of her being at Twickenham; her putting herself in the power of a servant; it was the detection, in short—oh, Fanny! It was the imprudence which had brought things to extremity, and obliged her brother to give up every dearer plan in order to fly with her.\" She went on, began to talk of you; yes, then she began to talk of you, regretting, as well she might, the loss of such a—. My dearest Fanny, I am giving you, I hope, more pleasure than pain by this retrospect of what might have been—but what never can be now. She spoke of you with high praise and warm affection; yet, even here, there was alloy, a dash of evil; for in the midst of it she could exclaim, 'Why would not she have him? Had she accepted him as she ought, they might now have been on the point of marriage, and Henry would have been too happy and too busy to want any other object. It would have all ended in a regular standing flirtation, in yearly meetings at Sotherton and Everingham.'"},"words":[{"w":"generator","uk":"/ˈdʒenəreɪtə(r)/","us":"/ˈdʒenəreɪtər/","p":"n.","m":"发电机","f":["regenerator"],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"syntax","uk":"/ˈsɪntæks/","us":"/ˈsɪntæks/","p":"n.","m":"句法","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"prefix","uk":"/ˈpriːfɪks/","us":"/ˈpriːfɪks/","p":"n.","m":"词首，前缀；前置代号","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"opt","uk":"/ɒpt/","us":"/ɑpt/","p":"v.","m":"选择","f":["optical"],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"stadium","uk":"/ˈsteɪdiəm/","us":"/ˈsteɪdiəm/","p":"n.","m":"体育场，运动场","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"gym","uk":"/dʒɪm/","us":"/dʒɪm/","p":"n.","m":"体育活动","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":"yoga","uk":"/ˈjəʊɡə/","us":"/ˈjəʊɡə/","p":"n.","m":"瑜伽","f":[],"c":[],"o":null,"q":null,"b":null,"b2":null},{"w":